findings.evidence:
src/lib/agent/verify.ts:42 builds `` `<evidence>
${evidenceBlock(evidence)}
</evidence>

<answer>
${answer.slice(0,6000)}
</answer>` `` — `evidenceBlock` is not wrapped in `sanitizeFences` here, unlike both call sites in prompts.ts (lines 87, 91), and `answer` is never sanitized at all. `sanitizeFences` also does not know the `answer` token.
